    "created_at": "2021-07-08T14:24:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-08T14:25:02Z",
    "body": "This issue has come up with the web component community which wants to establish common event types but want to avoid name collisions, see: https://github.com/webcomponents/community-protocols/issues/19#issuecomment-876482731\r\n\r\nAllowing symbols as event types would resolve this issue for us. Is there still implementer interest in this idea?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
